# Bookmarklets
Personal bookmarklet toolbox with source, minified builds, metadata catalog, and a GitHub Pages dashboard.

bookmarklets/
│
├── src/                 # Raw, readable JS source files
│   ├── clean-ui.js
│   ├── darkmode.js
│   └── autofill.js
│
├── dist/                # Minified bookmarklet versions
│   ├── clean-ui.min.js
│   ├── darkmode.min.js
│   └── autofill.min.js
│
├── catalog.json         # Metadata for dynamic loading
│
├── index.html           # Bookmarklet dashboard (GitHub Pages)
│
└── README.md            # Documentation
